  "id": "microcounseling",
  "term": "microcounseling",
  "definition": "Microcounseling is a counselling theory that identifies basic techniques shared across counselling and organizes them into a hierarchical framework. It breaks broader interpersonal communication abilities into specific skills that can be analyzed, taught, and evaluated.",
